				""
				"The &e&lCoke Oven&r is used to make &aCoke&r from &eCoal&r, or &aCharcoal&r from &eWood&r, in addition to &dliquid Creosote&r as a &3bonus&r output."
				""
				"Take a look at the &6Multiblock Preview&r tab in JEI (press &dU&r over the controller block of any Multiblock!) to see the structure pattern."
