				"&l&8[&6PROJECT-MANAGER&8]"
				""
				"Well, you may be wondering what &6&lTHE PROJECT&r&r is. See while you were out commiting &ccrimes&r and crafting a &cdevious&r plot, the rest of us respectable people have real problems to solve. Like the ever growing need for our &agovernment&r to have more and more power. We have long &boutgrown&r the resources of just our home, and we need people like you to deliver the items we need most. In a way, you can think of it as &asaving&r the planet, or saving your pet cat."
